  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is a joint collaboration between Sightsavers and CBM to start the process towards strengthening the capacity of the Plateau State government in Nigeria to provide a sustainable and integrated eye health program which will improve eye health outcomes and reduce inequalities in access to eye health, while demonstrating inclusion at all levels.</narrative>
  </description>
